##question 7 
```{r}
#Use at least two different graphical representations to assess 
#whether Time to conversion depends on Campaign theme and comment the results,
#especially by comparing the two solutions.
#version 1 : boxplot 
ggplot(dataset, aes(x=`Campaign theme`, y= `Time to conversion`, fill=`Campaign theme`))+
  geom_boxplot() + 
  theme_minimal()+
  theme(legend.position = "none")
```
```{r}
#overlapping densities 
ggplot(dataset, aes(x=`Time to conversion`, fill=`Campaign theme`))+
  geom_density(alpha=0.4)+
  theme_minimal()
